  "title": "Zavelyn Diesel Injector Removal Kit",
  "body_html": "<h2><span style=\"color: #ff8000;\">FEATURES</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"1\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<article class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{\"copyFrom\":\"im-native\"},[\"p\",{},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"asy removal:** 21pcs universal pneumatic diesel fuel injector puller tool kit features an air-powered tool that uses vibrations and torque to quickly and effectively remove tight or seized diesel injectors caused by carbon buildup or corrosion. No matter how tough the injector is, it can be easily removed, improving repair efficiency.\"]]]]'>\n<p><span><strong>Easy removal: </strong>21pcs universal pneumatic diesel fuel injector puller tool kit features an air-powered tool that uses vibrations and torque to quickly and effectively remove tight or seized diesel injectors caused by carbon buildup or corrosion. No matter how tough the injector is, it can be easily removed, improving repair efficiency.</span></p>\n</article>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0873/0440/5294/files/1_c2091d4c-9d71-4061-acf3-2a9524907472.jpg?v=1776937141\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<article class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie=\"[&quot;root&quot;,{&quot;copyFrom&quot;:&quot;im-native&quot;},[&quot;p&quot;,{},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;Wide compatibility:** With different-sized adapters, this pneumatic injector puller kit gives you the flexibility to work on a wide range of diesel vehicles. It ensures a perfect fit, making it easy to use across multiple diesel engines for quick and efficient service. Whether you're working on light-duty or heavy-duty engines, this kit is designed to meet your needs.&quot;]]]]\">\n<p><span><strong>Wide compatibility:</strong> With different-sized adapters, this pneumatic injector puller kit gives you the flexibility to work on a wide range of diesel vehicles. It ensures a perfect fit, making it easy to use across multiple diesel engines for quick and efficient service. Whether you're working on light-duty or heavy-duty engines, this kit is designed to meet your needs.</span></p>\n</article>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0873/0440/5294/files/2_1874ce57-e639-43b0-928f-3b387fc68ab6.jpg?v=1776937141\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"1\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<article class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{\"copyFrom\":\"im-native\"},[\"p\",{},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Packaging contents:** The kit includes an air vibration tool, air hose with plug, and a variety of adapters for multiple diesel injector types.\"]]]]'>\n<p><span><strong>Packaging contents: </strong>The kit includes an air vibration tool, air hose with plug, and a variety of adapters for multiple diesel injector types.</span></p>\n</article>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0873/0440/5294/files/7_db1d571c-7e54-42b7-8780-0b86d1ef6482.jpg?v=1776937141\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"1\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<article class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{\"copyFrom\":\"im-native\"},[\"p\",{},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Organized storage:** Built from high-quality materials for long-lasting durability, this diesel engine removal tool delivers reliable performance. It comes with a rugged, blow-molded carrying case to keep everything organized and protected. The case makes storage easy, prevents tools from getting lost, and ensures quick, hassle-free access whenever you need them for repairs or maintenance.\"]]]]'>\n<p><span><strong>Organized storage:</strong> Built from high-quality materials for long-lasting durability, this diesel engine removal tool delivers reliable performance. It comes with a rugged, blow-molded carrying case to keep everything organized and protected. The case makes storage easy, prevents tools from getting lost, and ensures quick, hassle-free access whenever you need them for repairs or maintenance.</span></p>\n</article>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0873/0440/5294/files/4_d25828be-5577-40d4-9c0b-509a789047a7.jpg?v=1776934281\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"1\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<article class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{\"copyFrom\":\"im-native\"},[\"p\",{},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Durable design:** Made for professional use, this injector puller kit combines high-quality materials and precise engineering to ensure long-term reliability and efficient injector removal.\"]]]]'>\n<p><span><strong>Durable design:</strong> Made for professional use, this injector puller kit combines high-quality materials and precise engineering to ensure long-term reliability and efficient injector removal.</span></p>\n</article>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0873/0440/5294/files/3_0e2f0904-ad7d-446e-a541-7edbd8925c4d.jpg?v=1776934281\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff8000;\">PACKAGE INCLUDES</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1* Zavelyn® Universal Diesel Injector Removal Kit</span></p>",
